{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Out of Babylon we [Bb/D]came
To Jeru[Cm7]salem and Judah
[Abmaj7]Walking back to our own [Eb/G]town
Each [F7sus4]man to his own [Bbsus4]place [Bb]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Under Zerubbabel's [Bb/D]lead
With Jeshua [Cm7]and Nehemiah
[Abmaj7]We climbed up from the ex[Eb/G]ile
Res[F7sus4]toring what was [Bb]lost
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Ab]The sons of Hasup[Bb]ha
[Eb]Temple [Bb/D]servants faith[Cm7]ful
[Ab]Serving at the [Bb]house
Keeping the [Eb]sacred trust
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Eb] | [Eb] | [Bb/D] | [Cm7] |
| [Abmaj7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Alongside Ziha and Tab[Bb/D]baoth
In the list [Cm7]of the returned
[Abmaj7]We settled near the tem[Eb/G]ple
To [F7sus4]carry out our [Bb]part
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Cm7]Lived on Ophel [Bb]high
[Eb]Serving [Bb/D]God's holy [Cm7]place
[Ab]Duties assigned to [Bb]us
In this re[Eb]stored time
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Ab]The sons of Hasup[Bb]ha [Eb]
[Bb/D]Faithful to the [Cm7]end
{end_of_verse}

